 class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20260322015634&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Captain_Indigo_ec29e3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Captain Indigo.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Passage to Thais here!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Targuna\">Targuna</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Passage to</th>\n<th>Cost (gp)</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">0</td>\n<td>After paying 5,000 or providing a Sail Pass\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Captain Indigo.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: Welcome on board. Where can I <b>sail</b> you today?<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: My name is Captain Indigo from the Royal Tibia Line.<br/>\nPlayer: job / Captain Indigo<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: I'm the captain of this ship.<br/>\nPlayer: routes / Tibia<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: The Royal Tibia Line connects all seaside towns of Tibia.<br/>\nPlayer: goods<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: We can transport everything you want.<br/>\nPlayer: passage<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: If you want I can sail you to <b>Thais</b>. It is our capital and the oldest city in Tibia.<br/>\nPlayer: Darashia<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: I'm not sailing there as this route is afflicted by a <b>ghost</b> ship. However, I heard that Captain Fearless sails there from <b>Venore</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: ghost<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: Many people who sailed to Darashia never returned because they were attacked by a ghost ship. Thus I'm not sailing there.<br/>\nPlayer: Venore and some cities<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: Sorry, but I'm not sailing there.<br/>\nPlayer: Ice Islands<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: I'm sorry, we don't serve the routes to Senja, Folda or Vega but I could bring you to Thais.<br/>\nPlayer: Thais<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: You want me to sail you to Thais?<br/>\nPlayer: no<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: I wish you a pleasant stay here then.<br/>\nPlayer: farewell / bye<br/>\nCaptain Indigo: Good bye.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Captain Indigo</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["targuna-quest"],"pos":{"x":31973,"y":31892,"z":6}}